# Paths that define what "correct" means for Hearth, and the machinery that checks it.
# A pull request touching any of them needs an approving review from a code owner.
# This only binds with branch protection on main: "Require review from Code Owners", "Dismiss
# stale pull request approvals when new commits are pushed" and the required status checks
# (governance/README.md, "CI"). GitHub ignores a line whose owner has no write access, so keep the
# owners real accounts or teams of this repository. The last matching line wins.
# Patterns are case-sensitive: a twin such as governance/invariants.md is not covered here. The
# required gates (golden.yml, decisions.yml) refuse any merge commit with such twins.

# Verification authority (INV-VERIFY) and the zero-loss constraint lane
/tests/golden/                  @pierce-lonergan
/governance/INVARIANTS.md       @pierce-lonergan

# The golden suite's oracle: tests/golden takes its expected values and fixtures from these
# modules (the reference model, quantisation, the synthetic models and what they import from
# the package), so changing them changes what the golden tests accept
/python/hearth/__init__.py      @pierce-lonergan
/python/hearth/reference.py     @pierce-lonergan
/python/hearth/quant.py         @pierce-lonergan
/python/hearth/synth.py         @pierce-lonergan
/python/hearth/format.py        @pierce-lonergan
/python/hearth/presets.py       @pierce-lonergan

# Decisions: rewriting or retiring an ADR trips the breaker, and the label alone is not the review
/governance/decisions/          @pierce-lonergan

# The tools that judge a change, and the workflows and rules that run them
/governance/tools/              @pierce-lonergan
/governance/schemas/            @pierce-lonergan
/.github/                       @pierce-lonergan

# Contracts (maintainer-only per governance/README.md, "Elastic autonomy")
/engine/include/hearth.h        @pierce-lonergan
/engine/src/hx_*.h              @pierce-lonergan
/docs/FORMAT.md                 @pierce-lonergan
/docs/NUMERICS.md               @pierce-lonergan
/governance/tasks.json          @pierce-lonergan
